---
// The mark every link to another origin carries (Global Constraints: links): a visible ↗ and the
// screen-reader text "(opens in a new tab)". Put it last inside the <a>; linkAttrs() adds the target/rel.
---
<span class="ext-mark" aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span>
